      "description": "Proton VPN is the world's only free VPN app that is safe to use and respects your privacy. \n\n• Trusted by millions worldwide\n• No sign-up required, no data-selling\n• No ads, no tracking, no logs\n• Unblocks access to private internet and popular websites\n• Unlimited bandwidth for streaming and downloading\n• Hide your real IP address to browse anonymously\n\n\n FREE VPN FEATURES:\n\n• Access secure VPN servers in 10 countries\n• Bypass geo restrictions: smart protocol selection automatically overcomes VPN bans and unblocks censored sites and content\n• One tap Connect: no login or registration needed\n• Browse with unlimited data\n• Stay protected on any network — WiFi, 5G, 4G, public hotspots and more\n• DNS and IP leak protection\n• Strict no logs policy and strong encryption to keep your data safe from hackers and snoopers\n• Auto kill switch means you're never exposed, even if the VPN connection drops\n\n\nPREMIUM VPN FEATURES:\n\n• Access 20,000+ high speed servers across 140+ countries worldwide including US, UK, France, Germany, India, Brazil, Mexico, Japan, South Korea, etc.\n• Block ads, prevent website trackers, protect from malware with NetShield\n• Connect up to 10 devices simultaneously\n• Fast VPN servers: high-speed server compatible for high-bandwidth use, with connections up to 10 Gbps for express download and upload speed\n• Secure connections compatible with file-sharing and P2P traffic\n• Secure Core servers bypass network-based attacks with multi-hop VPN\n• Tor over VPN provides automatic integration with the Tor anonymity network\n\nUSE PROTON VPN FOR:\n• Stay in touch on any messaging app (Telegram, WhatsApp, Messenger, Discord etc)\n• Explore any social media platform (TikTok, Instagram, Facebook, Snapchat, Twitter/X, Reddit etc)\n• Watch films, sports events, and videos on any streaming service (Netflix, Hulu, Amazon Prime Video, Disney+, Max, BBC iPlayer etc)\n• Enjoy any mobile game (PUBG Mobile, Call of Duty: Mobile, Fortnite, Minecraft, Genshin Impact)\n• Stay secure on public WiFi at school, work, or on the go\n• Keep your browsing private from your Internet Service Provider or employer\n\n\nWHY PROTON VPN?\n• Easy-to-use VPN app for iPhone, iPad, visionOS, tvOS, Mac, and any other major devices\n• Highest strength encryption for your connection makes it better than an internet proxy\n• We only use VPN protocols that are proven to be secure: WireGuard\n• Independently audited by third-party security experts and we publish all results on our website\n• Trusted open-source code that can be reviewed for security by anyone\n• Data protection using AES-256 and 4096 RSA encryption\n\nJoin the privacy revolution\n• Your support is important as it allows us to continue our mission to bring online freedom to people around the globe. Get our private VPN free today and enjoy fast VPN connections and a secure internet, from anywhere.\n\n\nExperts’ opinion:\n\nWired: \"The best VPN\" \"Overall, Proton VPN is very fast\"\n\nMashable: \"[Proton VPN] is the top VPN for most people. It's a stellar value.\"\n\nTechRadar: “The completely free tier is something no other competitor [...] offers.\"",
